    "notes": "Precision PPS-CF/GF profile for the Bambu Lab H2C with a 0.2mm hardened nozzle. Designed for SMT solder jigs, fixtures, and tolerance-critical PPS parts where features as narrow as 0.15mm must print correctly, including on the first layer. Pair with the Bambu Studio Generic PPS-CF filament preset (verified driver for Fiberon PPS-GF). Key deviations from the engineering PPS profile: Arachne wall generator with min_bead_width 75% (= 0.15mm on 0.2mm nozzle), initial_layer_line_width dropped to 0.15mm with 0.08mm first-layer height for ~1.9:1 bead aspect, outer-wall speed 30 mm/s and outer-wall accel 800 for dimensional accuracy, brim widened to 10mm to compensate for the thinner first layer. Peak volumetric flow ~1.4 mm^3/s — extremely safe at PPS temperatures. CALIBRATION REQUIRED before final print: (1) outer-wall flow ratio on a single-wall cube, (2) XY tolerance test (e.g. tolerance ring) since PPS shrinks 1-2% and your jig pockets must fit components, (3) pressure advance per filament/temperature. Use the engineering PPS profile instead for non-fixture structural parts."
